<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 27.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 27.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     June 27     June 26   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  273.000     272.780     247.020   10.52 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.700     309.940     306.830    0.94 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.905     158.110     158.970   -0.67 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.814	46.858	47.182   -0.78 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  455.740     455.000     419.180    8.72 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.320     140.480     141.685   -0.96 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.134	16.189	16.185   -0.32 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  238.540     239.760     212.430   12.29 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.868	 1.870	 1.888   -1.06 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.562	 1.566	 1.581   -1.20 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.415     189.475     183.135    3.43 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
